    "title": "Prompt nav",
    "description": "Prompt navigation: buttons, keys, and an outline that jump between your own messages in a long session. It only adds to the app: no tools, routes, or stored data. It reads messages with `pocket.messages` and jumps with `pocket.reveal`, so the server checks each person's access. While Pi works in a session, its buttons step aside for Steer, Queue, and Stop.",
